27153-lunalupa\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27153_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27153\" data-vbnamecard=\"27153\">LunaLupa</a> could a telltale type 'cinematic' video game work for mummy,<br /> <br /> \u2022An XCOM style hunter: the vigil game(most likely a tier 3 game)<br /> \u2022A Changeling survival horror game abt your character's durance","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-24T14:40:03-07:00","id":1495536,"title":"","content":"A Mummy CRPG feels very apt, especially one focused less on combat and more on dialogue and puzzles. Kind of a Planescape: Torment type deal, except without party members and the 'preasure' of your quickly draining mystical power.<br /> <br /> I'd also love an adventure game/RPG for Hunter. None of this hacking and slashing through hordes of ghouls nonsense, the monsters are just straight up more powerful than your character/cell. So each hunt is primarily focused on collecting information and making preparations so that when the big confrontation does happen you're not just immediately obliterated. I'm imagining an isometric viewpoint with very occasional turn based battles, although something more modern in feel could also work. Something XCOM like could work, but I'd personally much rather see a tier 1 or 2 game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-24T18:02:48-07:00","id":1495539,"title":"","content":"An urban fantasy date sim. Because someone is going to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-24T21:37:05-07:00","id":1495550,"title":"","content":"A sin-eater rpg, with a list of Geists to choose from, each one with a different Remembrance.<br /> The main character death and Burden are randomly and proceduraly generated<br /> It would be a lot of work, but worth it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https:/