ion gathering and tech Gnostic heists</div> </div> </div> </div>So a magitech GTA?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-25T09:43:44-07:00","id":1495577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newb95</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1495528-hypothetical-cofd-video-games?p=1495557#post1495557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would go with an narrative/investigative rpg using baseline human characters that will slowly discover the world after dark, think of it like Disco Elysium only set in CoD, from there you could branch to pretty much any splat, fuck a mage game similar to Disco Elysium would be incredible...</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah for Mage I was considering either a Investigative CRPG like DE where instead of gaining thoughts like Disco you get Enlightened Truths or maybe a mystery Point-and-Click.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27153-lunalupa","name":"LunaLupa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27153_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"k